     1636     field fact-qnty as decimal
     1637     field free-qnty as decimal
     1638     field sts_err   as logical
     1639     field DelivCodeMis   as logical
     1640     field UnitCli   as character
     1641     field UnitCliQnty as decimal
     1642     field isMarking   as logical
     1643     field isArtic     as logical
     1644     field isWeight    as logical
     1645     field isVarWeight as logical
     1646     field isSelect    as logical
