     1674     index pi2 mark-parent sts
     1675     index pi3 unit-ext
     1676     index pi4 mark obj-type obj-code gds-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     1677     index part gds-code obj-type obj-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     1678     index gds-code gds-code
